160	\cls{} achieves fail \fone{} 87.86\% (precision 82.75\%, recall 93.64\%) at seed 42, with 42.1\% of problems perfectly predicted. Multi-F2P instances (6--10 tests) reach 96.3\% accuracy, corroborating the oracle finding.
